      "message": "nit: this must be an adaptation of code from bn_lib, but would it be more readable to do something more structural\n\nBN_ULONG* word;\n/* do length checks */\nfor (i\u003d0, word\u003da-\u003ed; i\u003ca-\u003etop; i++, word++, to+\u003dBN_BYTES) {\n  BN_ULONG_to_LEULONG(word, to);\n}\nmemset(to, 0, tolen - i*BN_BYTES);\n\nwhere BN_ULONG_to_LEULONG(BN_ULONG* word, u_char* to) {\n  for (i\u003d0; i\u003cBN_BYTES; i++) {\n    *to++ \u003d BN_ULONG_lebyte(*word, i);\n  }\n}\n\nand BN_ULONG_lebyte(BN_ULONG value, int nbyte) {\n  return (value \u003e\u003e (BN_BYTES - nbyte + 1)*8) \u0026 0xFFu;\n}",
